2. HaMeR (Hand Mesh Recovery)
   Used by: the hand-pose backend behind the hamer_camera1 / hamer_camera3
            stages, when that backend is configured.
   License: see the upstream repository and its model-weight terms.

3. LeRobot
   Used by: adapters/prepare_pi05_ego_fruit_lerobot.py at runtime.
   License: see the upstream repository.

4. Nero / Revo2 robot SDK and URDF
   Used by: adapters/build_ego_fruit_ik_trajectory.py through
            --ik-backend-script.
   License: vendor-specific. Not distributed here.

5. MediaPipe, MANO, and other hand models
   Not distributed. Any of them may be substituted for the hand-pose backend if
